# Development Environment Shutdown

1) Stop the web dev server
   - In the terminal running `npm run dev`: press Ctrl+C

2) Stop local Supabase
   ```powershell
   cd C:\Projects\Cursor\Projects\YMCA\YMCA-Attendance-Web
   "C:\Program Files\Supabase CLI\supabase" stop
   ```

3) Optional Docker cleanup (to free space)
   ```powershell
   docker system prune -a
   ```
   - Warning: this removes all stopped containers and unused images.
   - Close Docker Desktop if you want to save resources.









